{
  "name": "Mystic Fighting Style",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you take the Attack Action on your turn, you can replace one of the attacks with a casting of one of your Sorcerer cantrips that has a casting time of an Action.</p><p>Any feature that increases the damage die size of your Unarmed Attack also increases the size of one of your damaging cantrips' dice by the same number of steps. For the purposes of this feature, the initial effect of your Martial Arts feature counts as one step, as do any further increments acquired through Monk levels. This feature has no effect when you are wielding a weapon.</p>",
